Z||000000||NIFE [PaulV]||07-02-2001||10:17 PM||||As of June 30th, 451 raffle tickets have been sold to Fiero Enthusiasts in 33 states & Canada. Now there are only 149 left before the drawing on Sept 9th, 2001 at the NIFE Fierorama in Oak Brook IL. 1st prize is a Red 88GT T-Top, 5-speed, with 67K original miles. 2nd place is a $1400.00 Mr. Mike's leather interior package, and 3rd place is a $500.00 gift certificate to the Fiero Store. Pictures, more info, and a ticket application is available at   <A HREF="http://www.FieroFocus.com/NIFERaffle.htm" TARGET=_blank>www.FieroFocus.com/NIFERaffle.htm</A> <BR>If you have put off buying a ticket(s), now may be a good time!<P>If you want to use PayPal, send me an email for instructions.<P>Paul Vargyas<BR>Northern Illinois Fiero Enthusiasts<BR>Lisle, IL. (Chicago area)<BR>630-983-6434<BR>paulv@xnet.com<BR>||||reg||1
