Z||000008||KissMySSFiero||07-03-2001||06:40 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.fierofocus.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fierofocus.com</A> <BR>MM<BR>i live in indiana as well.  not as far as you but still.  i joined at twin lakes on may 5th.  some benefits i have seen already: discounts at fiero store(anyclub will do there), fierorama is free to enter for NIFE members, the newsletter is great,  you get a discount from mcgrath motors,  theyre a gm dealer so you can get factory parts and i believe 20% off.  i know there is a lot more.  email paul v and he can tell you all about it.  he's the membership director.  so far its been a great club.<P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:SSFiero <P>88FORMULA<BR>      <A HREF="mailto:SSFiero@Aol.com">SSFiero@Aol.com</A>       <P>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg">           <BR>"Kids in the backseat cause accidents,  accidents in the backseat caused me!!"||||reg||1
Z||000009||Dave Gunsul||07-04-2001||02:46 AM||||<BR>If anyone would like to learn more about N.I.F.E. please feel free to visit our website at: <A HREF="http://www.fierofocus.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fierofocus.com</A> <P>Besides all the things that SS listed above<BR>I would like to mention that our newsletter has won three Golden Quill awards!<BR>This year also marks the 10th ann. of NIFE.<P>Our membership is very diverse and a VERY fun<BR>loving bunch. Come check us out,we'll leave the light on for ya'.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||14
